Skill and command fixtures for packages/ai/src/ext/skills_test.zig.

project/  a workspace: .claude/skills holds the Claude Code docs examples
          (deploy, pr-summary), .zigguro holds zigguro skills and commands,
          pkg/.zigguro/skills is a nested root.
user/     the user's configuration directory.
managed/  the managed (policy) directory.

Collisions: explain (user beats project), deploy (a skill beats a command
of the same source), review (managed beats project).
